speechtext:
For a return showing:
1.	The names and addresses of all persons hired under the Canadian farm loan board in Saskatchewan;
2.	How much they received as commissions, salaries and expenses in each of the last three years;
3.	(a) How much money has been loaned by the said board, and (b) how much has been repaid to the board during each of the last three years;
4.	The total amount owing to the board at the end of the last fiscal year.
